          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>item</code></td><td><code>{ item, level, expanded, active }</code></td><td>Custom entry content, a group's included — <code>expanded</code> is the group's state. The chevron stays the menu's</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>actions</code></td><td><code>{ item, level, active }</code></td><td>Controls beside a leaf entry's link, in a row with it — never inside it</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

